> Title: Development 1.0.0
> Note: This is the Development release of 1.0.0, this contains untested features, and stuff that may be removed from the release of 1.0.0.

> What does this release add/remove/change:
- Added Vehicles (Helicopters, Cars)
        - Cars: BTR80, HMMWV, Haldor 940, Northstar W-200
        - Helicopters: Bell UH-1
- Added Firearms (LMGs, Rifles, Pistols, Snipers, Explosives)
        - Pistols: Glock 17
        - Rifles: AK-47
        - LMGs: PKM
        - Snipers: Remington R11 RSASS
        - Explosives: RPG-7
- Added NPCs (Zombies, Traders, Bandits, Civilians)
- Added General Gameplay Enhancements
- Added Player Attributes (Inventory Weight, Blood, Stamina, Radioactivity)
- Added Squad Support (Inviting Friends to your Squad will highlight them on the map, and benefit in the lobby.)
- Added Proximity Chat, and Radios that function both over Voice Chat & Chat messages.
- Added Character Creation on First Join (Disabled on Development Branch)
